  "title": "ieee802154: Fix FCS format resolution for top-level frame dissections",
  "description": "When called as a top-level link dissector via wtap_encap,\npacket-frame passes (void *)pinfo->pseudo_header in data.\nChecking only `if (data)` caused the dissector to treat the zeroed\npseudo_header as an int pointer, unintentionally forcing CC24xx\nmetadata mode and ignoring user FCS preferences.\n\nCheck that data != pinfo->pseudo_header before dereferencing as\nan int pointer passed by sub-dissectors.",
